---
import Clipping from "~/components/Clipping.astro"
import Note from "~/components/Note.astro"

/* Spread 10 — the second and third lamp. The yellow sheet. */
---

<section class="tc-sector" id="tc-sector-10" aria-label="Page 10: Again, but slower">
    <p class="spread-head t-eyebrow">
        <span>p. 10</span>
        <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>wednesdays no. 10 – 11</span>
    </p>

    <h2 class="spread-title t-display" data-reveal>Again, but <em>slower</em></h2>

    <p class="spread-note t-body">
        Second one: grain the right way, base measured twice. Third one: we
        stopped talking while wiring. That was the difference.
    </p>

    <Clipping
        id="10-0"
        src="shade"
        caption="no. 2 — stands ✓"
        x={120}
        y={330}
        w={270}
        h={370}
        kind="polaroid"
        rotate={-3}
    />

    <Clipping
        id="10-1"
        src="bulb"
        caption="on. off. on."
        x={500}
        y={400}
        w={400}
        h={260}
        kind="riso"
        ink="blue"
    />

    <Note x={960} y={420} w={260} rotate={-3} size="lg" tone="blue" arrow="left">
        no. 3 — the quiet one
    </Note>
</section>
